          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p02.r01",
            "text": "That teaching plan also explains the pacing of the early part of the series.",
            "type": "C",
            "cites": []
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p02.r02",
            "text": "The first six lectures are introductory and are meant to give a feel for the whole series while building conceptual understanding at a fundamental level.",
