              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1166"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p02.r03",
            "text": "From lecture 7 onward, the material moves deeply into code and begins a stage.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1168",
              "z9fgKz1Drlc@1170"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch01.s11.p02.r04",
            "text": "The approach combines whiteboard explanation with coding so that details and code are learned together, because theory and practical implementation are both treated as important.",
            "type": "F",
